{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What if... Victor Frankenstein had competition? </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099970/extras/dd88403752c8bb8c5a5d1f0316a31cc0.avif?t=1773979408\" width=1508 height=314 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORK ALONGSIDE A MONSTER </strong>from your collection, raiding across a large map to<strong>\u00a0GET THE PARTS YOU NEED FOR YOUR NEW MONSTER CREATION.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099970/extras/ea6f16b1396b67791efbe6b31cf09025.poster.avif?t=1773979408\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099970/extras/ea6f16b1396b67791efbe6b31cf09025.webm?t=1773979408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099970/extras/ea6f16b1396b67791efbe6b31cf09025.mp4?t=1773979408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Due to your hippocratic oath, any part you steal must have one left in its place, so<strong>\u00a0SWAP STRATEGICALLY</strong>\u00a0- Don't accidentally leave a rival scientist a part they need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099970/extras/e35f4233add1ca31026ee0d45973f1de.poster.avif?t=1773979408\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099970/extras/e35f4233add1ca31026ee0d45973f1de.webm?t=1773979408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099970/extras/e35f4233add1ca31026ee0d45973f1de.mp4?t=1773979408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When time's up, the<strong>\u00a0SCIENTIFIC SOCIETY WILL JUDGE YOUR NEW CREATION</strong>. Do better than your rivals to win - boosting your reputation and unlocking new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099970/extras/5b722b41f976aa83a756b15770ead619.poster.avif?t=1773979408\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099970/extras/5b722b41f976aa83a756b15770ead619.webm?t=1773979408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099970/extras/5b722b41f976aa83a756b15770ead619.mp4?t=1773979408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mary Shelley's creature (from the novel) is one of 13 voiced monsters you can <strong>BUILD AND COLLECT, </strong>each\u00a0referencing a different monster from the 200 years of\u00a0mad Frankenstein science.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0- SINGLEPLAYER &amp; MULTIPLAYER -</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the full game solo offline - against bot scientists, conquering 10 evolving contests. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or go multiplayer - a raucous 2D friendslop party game with voicechat and competitive banter, full of monster assaults, backstabbing raids, and excusing ridiculous creature-builds in front of a sceptical scientific audience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- WISHLIST &amp; FOLLOW -</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">To get updates, play the demo, or catch the discount on launch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099970/extras/c0edc0b5c6c1f6ebf846297b6028e3a4.avif?t=1773979408\" width=1560 height=898 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TLDR: Game's like <i>Among Us</i> meets a Gothic Creature Collector. Or a sequel mashup of <i>Project Winter</i> and <i>Graveyard Keeper</i>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4099970?t=1773979408","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099970/cc2216c36caaa2684430e3281145931bcce04efe/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773979408","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099970/47c1905955d1a4c10c491e887d3f9087ba268299/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773979408","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099970/47c1905955d1a4c10c491e887d3f9087ba268299/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773979408","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What if... Victor Frankenstein had competition? </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099970/extras/dd88403752c8bb8c5a5d1f0316a31cc0.avif?t=1773979408\" width=1508 height=314 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORK ALONGSIDE A MONSTER </strong>from your collection, raiding across a large map to<strong>\u00a0GET THE PARTS YOU NEED FOR YOUR NEW MONSTER CREATION.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst